{"id":"715287f14a88c4bd40fb6617c7411a9b9117b71e3570ee7ea3d2b9c87bd19d03","pubkey":"59317d32e89cbd5fb7e5f8e16bbee29e35f12b4bc6561c9a691cc068af0dbfbd","created_at":1781968995,"content":"安定の洋ゲー顔\nhttps://share.yabu.me/59317d32e89cbd5fb7e5f8e16bbee29e35f12b4bc6561c9a691cc068af0dbfbd/af585558aa7db83b9a3081827071469415b5390bb115c0e1ff6626165ef58a8a.webp","tags":[["client","eHagaki","31990:ec42c765418b3db9c85abff3a88f4a3bbe57535eebbdc54522041fa5328c0600:1754918316480"],["imeta","url https://share.yabu.me/59317d32e89cbd5fb7e5f8e16bbee29e35f12b4bc6561c9a691cc068af0dbfbd/af585558aa7db83b9a3081827071469415b5390bb115c0e1ff6626165ef58a8a.webp","m image/webp","x af585558aa7db83b9a3081827071469415b5390bb115c0e1ff6626165ef58a8a","ox af585558aa7db83b9a3081827071469415b5390bb115c0e1ff6626165ef58a8a","size 55876","dim 1024x576","blurhash U47m?2%100E2EMa#^P-T0Nn,~9oJ,usoJQNb"]]}
{"id":"5919a1dd182cd296b074216db44d800a1ab4239693ba6c2606ae8886bffb4b42","pubkey":"c7f98d207d9e80b14d7603ddfbbf57fe89cb8a9872029f00974198bbc5cbc5f2","created_at":1781968892,"content":"nostr_pass source code for a v00_01 POC is live. With it one can register the date of birth and do several checks, say a minor to purchase alcohol. Please check it out and give me all feedback you think of.\n\nThe whole vision is meterilising little by little.\n\nhttps://codeberg.org/slingshotsecurity/nostr_pass/src/branch/master/v00_01.md\n\nhttps://codeberg.org/slingshotsecurity/nostr_pass/\n\nhttps://angor.io/project/angor1qx37verakwcqve8t89l8hn35q2qa8p5q69qemtn\n\nFor more than a century, towards the state, we are not people and families; we are a serial number (a social security number, or an NIS). The internet eroded borders and state sovereignty, and with nostr_pass we have a way to quickly and easily coming together with people that are aligned with us, and staying away from people who are not. Nostr_pass could revert us back to being people, families and communities towards power (state power or corporate power), as it creates strong groups that can operate in an ethical manner and do not consider the fellow man a serial number, but a person with attributes that can be trusted or not.\n\nWe are facing the emergence of centralised digital id. These initiatives have large lobbies pushing it into legislation everywhere. This project may back a movement for legislation towards the use of decentralised digital ids with zero knowledge proofs, which would be much less tyrannical and allow people to own their data and not have the photos of their documents on hackable centralised databases, or their iris, or pattern of walking, or pattern of speaking, or DNA.","tags":[["alt","A short note: nostr_pass source code for a v00_01 POC is live. W..."],["r","https://codeberg.org/slingshotsecurity/nostr_pass/src/branch/master/v00_01.md"],["r","https://codeberg.org/slingshotsecurity/nostr_pass/