{"id":"32a5520987c1c7219b4e32e7a67001810c74fff33f9244bca477acbb9f124294","pubkey":"81913081246d192c9a55951704270756b222094470b3171e58bb5e3c42ee8db5","created_at":1781943659,"content":"G的形状\nhttps://media.libernet.app/s/9iaIht.jpg https://media.libernet.app/s/7fXTDF.jpg","tags":[["alt","A short note: G的形状\nhttps://media.libernet.app/s/9iaIht.jpg https..."],["r","https://media.libernet.app/s/9iaIht.jpg"],["r","https://media.libernet.app/s/7fXTDF.jpg"],["imeta","url https://media.libernet.app/s/9iaIht.jpg","x 8328a438688f5773d22510d0a527ea292f2b3ffa44e197d7cabbc97b06ed775f","size 34792","m image/jpeg","dim 600x754","blurhash _CE2tW8^-;jFkXRjV@00%haejYRjkCWB01kDD%Wsn$ayoz~p9FxuadtRn~s:%2xu%Mt5NGt7V@oe%LIUf,adNGR*s-IUj?IVozV@ogIVRkxuodWCxus:%MjZWBxuofWVj?","ox 8328a438688f5773d22510d0a527ea292f2b3ffa44e197d7cabbc97b06ed775f"],["imeta","url https://media.libernet.app/s/7fXTDF.jpg","x 8952ab8702978a46289d874e1f80b6929b26ab505a0112f184744e9f8ef2d9cb","size 32401","m image/jpeg","dim 600x750","blurhash _HD9Iz-P9aa#RQIWRk4:Ne%1oJWVofoe02Ip%2R*xuxtof~Vs.E2ogayRkRkxabHxtt6M{RjafIVjuazM|oyt6t6xuWBM|a}tQkBa}IpR*%LxtRjjuRk%1oyRlM|afWBoK","ox 8952ab8702978a46289d874e1f80b6929b26ab505a0112f184744e9f8ef2d9cb"],["client","Amethyst"]]}
{"id":"18201e188f65656f153774260bb1e57e1a8d7530abe1bd5a0e364510acddcd6a","pubkey":"81913081246d192c9a55951704270756b222094470b3171e58bb5e3c42ee8db5","created_at":1781943604,"content":"转\n\n香港理工大学和四川大学做了一个挺有意思的研究。\n\n研究发现，在小红书 女性自拍样本中，来自人均 GDP 较低地区的用户，修图幅度整体更大。\n而且她们更倾向于强化大眼睛，圆脸，小嘴和更白皙的皮肤等 婴儿特征。\n\n相比之下，北京，上海，广东，浙江等发达地区用户，修图幅度明显更小，照片更接近原貌。\n\n研究人员认为，在经济发展水平较低，资源竞争更激烈的环境里，人们更倾向于把自己塑造成具有婴儿特征的形象，因为这类特征通常会让人显得更无害，更亲和，也更容易获得他人的好感与支持。\n\n而在经济更发达的地区，人们获得社会认可的途径更加多元，对外貌的依赖相对较低，因此更倾向于保留自然和真实的形象。\nhttps://media.libernet.app/s/YbqVZE.jpg","tags":[["alt","A short note: 转\n\n香港理工大学和四川大学做了一个挺有意思的研究。\n\n研究发现，在小红书 女性自拍样本中，来自人均..."],["r","https://media.libernet.app/s/YbqVZE.jpg"],["imeta","url https://media.libernet.app/s/YbqVZE.jpg","x 6bb2819bac71363d8c7fb6a2d0cf26ebfa738897d86dfc1866bab4d7bd9dc35c","size 165183","m image/jpeg","dim 1996x1172","blurhash i6RWC;H?-6^jRiNGNx.8?v}p0001IUWB%2%M?a?b4nIUD%IVWCxu%M-:-;E1%Loz9ZIVV@%Mt6xa-;xtE1IpRkxut6s.ae","ox 6bb2819bac71363d8c7fb6a2d0cf26ebfa738897d86dfc1866bab4d7bd9dc35c"],["client","Amethyst"]]}
